Following Tuesday's discussion, I have attached a short note on the handoff f=
rom an administrator's CSV export to Aldridge's storage and access decisions.=
 Once you know which Aldridge department will be responsible for keeping the =
export, please let me know; it would also help to identify who decides access=
 and retention.

The ability to take out a CSV is not acceptance of seven-year retention withi=
n the service. We have kept #34 as an exception in the response; the custody =
arrangement is still to be determined on your side.

Thanks,
Michelle

